      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FISHING YARI (2) comes here following a speedy win over 340m at Hobart in 19.46. Has the ability and looks hard to top. TOP KADE (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (24.87) in a Free For All at Sale. Form at the trip sound including nine wins. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. MYSTERY NELL (3) turned in a solid run last start over 350m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 2.25 lengths (19.57). Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Has ability and can atone. LAMINATE (1) warrants respect with the drop in trip.",
